18	We have implemented a comprehensive sustainability program that touches every aspect of our business, from energy and water conservation to waste reduction and responsible sourcing. Our hotels are designed and operated with eco-efficiency in mind, incorporating cutting-edge technologies and sustainable materials to reduce our carbon footprint.\nEnergy Conservation: We prioritize energy-efficient lighting, heating, and cooling systems, as well as renewable energy sources whenever possible.\nWater Management: Our hotels feature low-flow fixtures and greywater recycling systems to minimize water consumption and waste.\nWaste Reduction: We have implemented robust recycling and composting programs, and we strive to eliminate single-use plastics throughout our properties.\nResponsible Sourcing: We partner with local suppliers and prioritize sustainable and ethically sourced products, from organic produce to eco-friendly amenities.	guest	policies	corporate	Example Corp Hospitality Group.docx	Our Eco-Friendly Initiatives	2025-12-18	[0.0046253223,0.008193389,0.0077462005,-0.03195558,-0.00073642127,0.0069662873,-0.008076968,0.0022587017,-0.027517771,0.012779787,-0.021598583,-0.013675841,-0.020629026,0.017348493,0.13101266,0.009093373,0.0052639907,0.015433198,0.0076053455,-0.015452868,-0.019705819,-0.00093011354,0.0066791633,-0.007673376,-0.023558041,-0.017454386,0.015012644,0.024297545,0.0067209136,0.00026044762,0.012699644,0.001857025,0.009687392,0.013812707,0.0016802271,-0.009744192,0.015164168,0.010339673,-0.0075069894,-0.007717653,-0.011439297,0.007552688,-0.021844797,-0.0010325798,-0.013968066,0.016897803,0.007380963,-0.00030377146,-0.0009659489,-0.0033650778,0.012787482,-0.010591988,-0.008273819,-0.15523292,-0.008657349,-0.013667007,-0.020724516,-0.013706836,0.023003187,-0.0055401274,-0.016185114,-0.0034467767,-0.0044397763,-0.0073572327,-0.033896524,-0.04039258,0.0010435001,0.022023648,0.03146564,0.03539755,-0.01571743,0.02167092,-0.007217243,-0.026896693,-0.0249096