each with the opening of Example Corp Party Times.\nJuly 1, 2023 - Example Corp Luxury Suites Unveils Rooftop Lounge in Los Angeles\nGuests can enjoy stunning city views and craft cocktails at the new rooftop lounge atop Example Corp Luxury Suites in Los Angeles.\nJune 1, 2023 - Example Corp Seaside Resort Expands in Honolulu, Hawaii\nExample Corp Hospitality Group announces the opening of a new tower at its popular Example Corp Seaside Resort in Honolulu.\nStay tuned for more exciting updates and announcements from Example Corp Hospitality Group as we continue to grow and innovate in the hospitality industry.	guest	policies	corporate	Example Corp Hospitality Group.docx	Recent Press Releases:	2025-12-18	[-0.04656939,0.015618987,0.0007673872,-0.040975235,-0.004848036,0.019586971,-0.009523813,-0.015500111,-0.04271753,0.0021397262,-0.005742924,-0.023394177,0.002948155,0.016765239,0.13211808,-0.0001717637,-0.0067135654,0.019540856,0.0054447935,0.0068622045,-0.004222055,-0.016912505,0.017806971,-0.034693636,0.008696258,-0.000212044,0.02359334,0.0035096114,0.019351806,-0.0034142511,0.0003895195,-0.0022774227,0.008838213,0.01765879,-0.005688933,0.023413261,-0.014797451,0.0025147323,0.012767772,-0.012701977,0.0070760176,0.00100056,-0.012533242,0.009636654,-0.0021645343,0.002682936,-0.019514957,-0.03113988,-0.0032952963,0.015721682,-0.0068289633,0.012674856,-0.013593415,-0.17059395,0.015061219,0.008337114,0.01879581,-0.008372808,0.007958646,0.0012639354,-0.0045559364,0.023698315,-0.0339448,-0.036170952,-0.009750627,-0.025420725,-0.0031388202,0.024612786,0.012991357,0.022777563,0.023035262,0.015728954,-0.012236084,-0.02099847,0.0036963827,-0.030053305,-0.012524519,-0.005252435,-0.000674353,0.023558196,-0.015086411,-0.014916233,-0.041023508,-0.043607537,0.02558858,-0.019289918,-0.017073883,-0.017638512,-0.01580952,0.010260276,-0.004034338,0.028776327,-0.0036505684,-0.005683028,-0.0276328,-0.0030419922,0.0022008447,0.013523098,-0.02393095,0.0028530003,0.026570145,-0.0068091853,