56	For families seeking extra privacy and space, our Interconnecting Rooms offer the perfect solution. These rooms feature an adjoining door that connects two separate guest rooms, allowing parents and children to have their own private spaces while still being conveniently connected. Interconnecting Rooms can be booked with a variety of room types, including standard rooms, family suites, or accessible rooms, to accommodate your specific needs.	guest	services	family-getaways	Example Corp Family Getaways.docx	Interconnecting Rooms	2025-12-18	[0.01951205,-0.017547304,-0.019919623,-0.022556186,-0.02824227,-0.0027549155,-0.012274393,0.026187979,-0.012805183,-0.010717352,-0.0068842154,0.004322189,-0.013433044,-0.002228593,0.12379309,-0.014060669,0.0066112326,0.01955123,0.007079453,-0.01421578,-0.010790936,0.02213817,0.015368675,0.0058216145,0.0076454184,0.0058968817,-0.012794318,0.00839028,0.008289806,-0.002862414,-0.007730182,-0.00027094464,-0.012928374,0.018634886,0.005699459,0.0047009243,0.0007149185,0.020463355,-0.011947645,0.00017744476,0.0049700127,0.028215552,-0.029049233,0.006134285,-0.0076279864,-0.010525391,0.015416633,0.023658171,-0.025792379,0.0180411,0.0074404436,0.0044918843,0.018084913,-0.17195304,0.012856435,-0.031611506,0.019480484,0.012443461,0.0077732257,0.00069686805,-0.0016357342,0.0027325214,-0.014835861,-0.012956658,-0.026265984,-0.008498288,0.026484642,0.0051250695,0.009588229,0.013459622,0.03600748,0.010491498,-0.023574565,-0.04296131,-0.0006097787,0.016808264,-0.0089279385,-0.008005552,-0.011195623,0.013047615,-0.0110675,-0.020528104,-0.04021862,-0.024810854,0.008715533,0.020546425,0.0032032533,0.009733895,-0.027139572,0.0073500853,0.003168539,0.017969673,0.028118521,-0.005618301,0.003511119,0.019955602,0.021845946,0.03408385,-0.041188035,0.01815911,0.027186632,-0.00043336555,0.0053781187,-0.003984722,-0.007471347,-0.015863715,-0.0006407932,0.0057222173,-0.020468492,0.05130091,0.010848974,0.010659091,-0.003995872,-0.021985836,-0.00799443,-0.155