78	As the sun sets and the stars begin to twinkle, gather your family for a truly magical movie experience like no other. Our outdoor movie theaters offer the perfect setting for snuggling up on cozy blankets and enjoying your favorite films against the breathtaking backdrop of the night sky. From classic family favorites to the latest blockbusters, our movie nights are sure to delight movie buffs of all ages.	guest	services	family-getaways	Example Corp Family Getaways.docx	Movie Nights Under the Stars	2025-12-18	[-0.01827781,-0.0122270575,0.0028844704,-0.049191456,0.010957211,-0.0029440091,0.008910768,0.0007738623,-0.014468355,-0.009169084,0.00740818,-0.018934011,-0.014459443,-0.0012833168,0.110587485,-0.029142318,0.0049976273,-0.00991726,0.003932036,0.015912127,-0.016604487,-0.018261878,0.028625878,-0.014758665,-0.007508244,-0.02038159,0.007041341,0.00017399629,0.030948173,0.013163199,0.01857064,0.0011328736,-0.008573013,0.004617903,-0.003941374,0.013720694,0.014643707,-0.005825012,0.020691453,-0.020990364,-0.0098214485,-0.036137503,0.010847327,-0.03689696,-0.02018486,0.014608952,0.0015950055,-0.040720876,-0.003557461,0.009202842,-0.012205394,-0.02409269,0.014286554,-0.16989699,-0.010796315,-0.007017311,-0.0197701,0.0077323155,0.02033365,-0.008405663,0.010968411,0.02395382,0.007876604,-0.062235862,-0.018761927,0.0068300315,-0.018380722,-0.012846132,0.00773452,0.008027743,-0.001765944,-0.008500094,-0.0073360354,0.00085426355,-0.0050730444,0.0077476124,0.027856762,-0.017456474,0.03426446,0.027138978,0.031002115,0.0047053243,-0.02957699,-0.033676893,0.023549335,-0.003409387,-0.0065935855,-0.0030069924,0.0028782315,0.030734487,0.0049749943,0.0037045656,-0.0047380677,0.009607889,-0.023025349,-0.001231488,-0.004904324,0.014615259,-0.017579712,0.014495105,-0.0030240044,-0.0068275486,0.020341195,0.028401235,-0.0051477873,0.006840544,0.015113421,-0.023370797,-0.027431414,0.04024106,-0.0052009947,0.0036534693,-0.006483784,-0.031932443,-0.001305441,-0.13868916,0.004316582,-0