91	For those days when you're on the go and in need of a quick bite, our casual eateries and food courts offer a variety of grab-and-go options that are sure to hit the spot. From fresh salads and wraps to burgers and fries, our casual dining spots cater to every craving. And with dedicated kids' menus featuring favorites like chicken tenders, grilled cheese, and personal pizzas, you can rest assured that your little ones will be fueled up and ready for more family fun.\nAt Example Corp Family Getaways, we believe that dining should be more than just a meal – it should be an experience that brings families together, creates lasting memories, and satisfies even the most discerning palates. So, gather your loved ones, come hungry, and get ready to embark on a delicious family dining adventure that will tantalize your taste buds and leave you craving for more.	guest	services	family-getaways	Example Corp Family Getaways.docx	Casual Eateries and Food Courts	2025-12-18	[-0.017890966,0.015273491,0.0025354084,-0.01736816,-0.019895226,-0.0057890746,-0.01733055,-0.0007177723,-0.038783368,0.0056217695,-0.005161509,-0.016058877,-0.017681757,-0.005076013,0.12501752,-0.00087703957,-0.00048002615,-0.0041075097,0.0033828376,-0.019436067,0.0040172827,0.01644604,0.03575825,0.013153664,-0.0048203203,-0.011884331,0.011552777,-0.0065427744,0.019894201,0.021258548,-0.0036855335,-0.010188348,0.015396988,0.022049919,-0.02245909,0.0046236822,0.01689509,-0.009350536,-0.004037631,-0.021305664,-0.032003455,-0.022073284,-0.030992808,0.006542394,0.008798942,-0.0011626637,-0.0013904396,-0.023072487,0.0064880466,0.051097304,-0.006756724,-0.014243178,0.014868818,-0.18516354,-0.0033329055,0.00016450968,-0.007119555,-0.001116306,0.016194792,0.0011834279,-0.021277161,0.012833766,-0.029766027,-0.015075834,-0.005184185,-0.0037901541,0.0023888517,0.013670229,-0.007609775,0.0058961334,0.007870016,-0.007701576,-0.025893021,-0.03693985,-0.018272324,-0.0029768334,-0.0135958735,-0.007422409,-0.0076439413,0.02