506	Imagine gathering with friends around the warm glow of a flickering fire, cocktails in hand, as the night sky twinkles overhead. Our outdoor party patios offer a unique and inviting atmosphere, where you can escape the hustle and bustle of the city and immerse yourself in the tranquility of nature, without sacrificing the energy and excitement of the party.\nPlush seating areas surround the fire pits, providing the perfect spot to relax, socialize, and soak in the ambiance. Whether you're roasting marshmallows and swapping stories, or simply basking in the warmth of the flames, our outdoor patios offer a cozy and inviting escape.	guest	services	party-times	Example Corp Party Times.docx	Embrace the Outdoor Ambiance	2025-12-18	[-0.0029900204,-0.016118076,0.007973922,-0.06571244,0.0034779066,-0.008159837,0.007371312,0.014204923,-0.018463377,-0.0067679775,0.008700258,-0.010635597,-0.0166339,0.0003135241,0.11523257,-0.03936559,0.019589694,-0.010168012,0.022891441,0.023214793,-0.0004826278,-0.022824844,0.02986009,-0.013792839,0.0011331346,0.0074420813,0.009604393,-0.019018305,0.02446121,-0.01850562,0.011939342,-0.008554623,-0.0005420122,0.0068740854,0.004695827,0.010730324,0.016173564,-0.015370488,-0.002148629,0.0043010977,-0.014336261,-0.024039736,-0.0052031074,-0.019835716,0.018359596,0.0036000595,0.011075717,-0.027203526,0.012078364,0.016051605,-0.014101251,-0.0021592292,0.013845189,-0.1545603,0.007782153,-0.020067682,-0.006747756,0.022134067,0.008342228,-0.00672786,0.012007942,0.0095084375,0.0060202344,-0.044236813,-0.026808951,-0.0053583346,-0.015241211,0.010900652,0.028485976,0.0114837745,-0.003725947,-0.0016055874,0.0068085906,0.00358563,-0.019006198,-0.021926973,-0.014333844,0.0032028328,0.020342981,0.04777746,0.005829717,0.002787431,-0.033500154,-0.03586629,0.01749039,-0.013532938,0.016093556,-0.01214547,0.012978986,0.020162035,-0.009451143,-0.014670422,0.020507341,0.0021868087,-0.015351396,-0.017404966,-0.0034568056,0.0048185447,-0.015887182,-0.0037711908,-0