560	Dive into the crystal-clear waters and explore the vibrant coral reefs teeming with a kaleidoscope of marine life. Our experienced guides will lead you on unforgettable snorkeling and scuba diving excursions, tailored to your skill level and interests.\nFor beginners, our certified instructors offer comprehensive lessons and guided tours, ensuring a safe and enjoyable introduction to these captivating underwater worlds. Experienced divers can venture further afield, exploring shipwrecks, underwater caves, and remote reef systems that few have the privilege of witnessing.\nSnorkeling Gear Rental: $25 per day\nBeginner Snorkeling Lesson: $50 per person\nCertified Scuba Diving Excursion: $150 per person (includes equipment)	guest	services	seaside-resorts	Example Corp Seaside Resorts.docx	Snorkeling and Scuba Diving Excursions	2025-12-18	[-0.007293352,-0.0018454338,-0.010277341,-0.06535143,0.014852377,0.004819919,0.021675363,-0.012526928,-0.013930821,-0.013318224,-0.021839049,0.0054832757,0.005328174,-0.0352377,0.13175097,-0.015260657,0.0116984425,0.021769801,0.012389623,-0.016705422,-0.012528321,0.0108615095,0.021394761,-0.044013508,-0.0043699387,0.018163318,0.026849505,0.007178045,0.014890014,0.007334398,-0.007153871,-0.02063335,-0.00223331,-0.004780288,-0.021727072,0.014934988,-0.0049094837,0.013175976,-0.006333911,0.0199255,-0.013671433,0.0060055964,-0.032861143,0.0050247516,-0.0076525654,0.0027700188,-0.010578979,-0.012112938,-0.00228296,0.03574428,-0.0054362174,-0.0016469236,0.010957837,-0.17137368,-0.0019357674,0.0094238,-0.0039435625,-0.02579602,0.0035453013,-0.0063153864,-1.371432e-05,0.04553961,-0.012753643,-0.035733994,-0.03650783,-0.009642472,-0.024319628,0.009779051,-0.02144605,-0.0057304334,0.012391202,0.015456516,0.018255986,-0.012196957,-0.00510874,-0.025063056,-0.018109746,-0.015053731,-0.008251908,0.04382429,0.03068379,-0.0068639573,-0.024310213,-0.0065092556,0.014809853,-0.015502985,-0.017082993,-0.0070832195,-0.0045042424,0.044651113,-0.010307788