561	Embrace the freedom of gliding across the tranquil waters on a kayak or stand-up paddleboard. Our Water Sports Center offers a variety of rentals, allowing you to explore the coastline at your own pace and discover hidden coves and secluded beaches accessible only by water.\nFor those seeking a more adventurous experience, join our guided kayaking tours and paddle through mangrove forests, or embark on a sunset paddle, where you can witness the breathtaking colors of the sky reflected on the water's surface.\nKayak Rental: $40 per hour\nStand-Up Paddleboard Rental: $30 per hour\nGuided Kayaking Tour: $75 per person	guest	services	seaside-resorts	Example Corp Seaside Resorts.docx	Kayaking and Stand-Up Paddleboarding	2025-12-18	[0.0084179,-0.0003019105,-0.010554632,-0.06395417,0.009736112,0.010640373,0.010698776,-0.006555173,-0.0075822365,0.01006446,-0.026720086,0.016463785,-0.005679276,-0.036436114,0.0993701,0.0051887897,0.006574856,0.020802138,0.015143265,-0.010130134,-0.004141224,-2.024749e-05,0.05182742,-0.011044177,-0.006448264,0.011463824,0.017583737,-0.008356499,0.014065898,-0.005725867,-0.026295617,-0.011616258,0.018808559,-0.008972042,0.004435374,0.023775293,0.032862037,0.0040697814,-0.005470982,0.04201636,-0.03191369,-0.011706403,-0.022040784,0.009057943,-0.013718399,0.004637476,-0.007959012,-0.023053301,-0.016226262,0.021342767,0.02477067,-0.036372628,0.02490829,-0.18580274,-0.011481742,0.0069234963,0.005326702,-0.021613304,0.013548194,0.015330879,-0.002774922,0.04831553,-0.017683461,-0.016053699,-0.034188204,0.0075333975,-0.009225988,0.014519779,-0.018514855,0.007597872,0.010790235,0.010420834,0.0072413,-0.014966063,-0.012646874,-0.015331845,-0.0044383826,-0.007117386,-0.02684679,0.03251695,0.007618858,-0.005926216,-0.01693189,-0.0031592045,0.013086721,-0.014238146,-0.013594614,-0.024727598,-0.01307729,0.01173805,0.0030586943,0.013920817,0.017310182,0.010532403,-0.0040097996,-0.009821466,-0.029237228,-0.017520286,-0.025300952,-0.0038724425,-0.016155358