584	At Example Corp Seaside Resorts, we strive to provide our guests with a safe, comfortable, and enjoyable experience. To ensure a harmonious environment for all, we kindly ask our guests to observe the following guest policies and regulations:\nCheck-In and Check-Out\nCheck-in time is 4:00 PM, and check-out time is 11:00 AM.\nEarly check-in and late check-out may be available upon request and subject to availability and additional charges.\nSmoking Policy\nAll guest rooms and public areas are strictly non-smoking.\nDesignated smoking areas are provided outside the resort buildings.\nNoise and Disturbances\nQuiet hours are observed from 10:00 PM to 8:00 AM.\nGuests are expected to respect the comfort and privacy of other guests and refrain from excessive noise or disruptive behavior.\nPool and Beach Areas\nSwimming pools and beach areas are open from 7:00 AM to 10:00 PM.\nAppropriate swimwear is required in all pool and beach areas.\nNo glass containers are permitted in the pool or beach areas.\nTowels are provided, and guests are kindly asked to return them to the designated areas.\nDining and Beverage Service\nProper attire is required in all dining establishments.\nOutside food and beverages are not permitted in the resort's restaurants and bars.\nAlcoholic beverages will not be served to guests under the legal drinking age.\nPets\nPets are not allowed in guest rooms or public areas, with the exception of service animals.\nDamage and Liability\nGuests are responsible for any damage or loss caused to the resort property or facilities.\nThe resort is not liable for any lost, stolen, or damaged personal belongings.\nSafety and Security\nGuests are advised to keep their room doors locked and to secure their valuables.\nIn case of emergencies, guests should follow the instructions of resort staff and emergency personnel.\nCompliance with Laws and Regulations\nGuests are expected to comply with all applicable laws and regulations during their stay.\nIllegal activities or behavior that compromises the safety and well-being of other guests or staff will not be tolerated.\nBy adhering to these policies and regulations, our guests can enjoy a safe, comfortable, and memorable stay at Example Corp Seaside Resorts. We appreciate your cooperation and understanding in helping us maintain a welcoming and enjoyable environment for all.	guest	services	seaside-resorts	Example Corp Seaside Resorts.docx	Guest Policies	2025-12-18	[-0.025416132,0.0027824056,-0.008160993,-0.025526501,0.011077442,0.019811174,-0.0018464108,0.009801923,-0.012268168,0.001642563,-0.015621234,-0.024340894,-0.013796359,0.011029717,0.12086147,0.0100591825,-0.004849531,-0.0035209998,-0.010036695,-0.0029528455,-0.011384189,-0.007736226,0.032233585,-0.023339918,0.0073315497,-0.009000411,0.025877206,0.02320306,0.01915342,-0.011981551,-0.008440164,-0.015264223,0.010986957,0.012322509,-0.005454265,0.022413436,0.0008716926,-0.011698141,-0.012730747,0.0066742445,0.010048577,0.0033422324,-0.023027599,0.010086357,-0.006809404,-0.00072002143,0.021674307,-0.00083749346,-0.0023864468,0.019266782,-0.0009115603,-0.010295322,-0.020264104,-0.19490401,0.007253163,-0.015646778,0.020411214,0.00010076737,-0.00046397158,-0.018565942,-0.02310683,0.017542016,-0.009371795,-0.0009913954,-0.010177399,-0.026421703,0.014451185,0.007207868,0.0201008,0.021137418,0.02115476,0.031744912,-0.004577391,-0.03553417,0.0085437875,0.00017421508,-0.011112261,-0.010529165,-0.018346153,0.016471148,0.022668574,-0.015834553,-0.002470709,-0.064505644,-0.0111102415,-0.016916113,-0.0035722998,0.007983098,-0.0009130716,0.027010562,0.012497756,0.025881011,0.015284788,0.025073208,-0.0016664567,0.0029608493,-0.01886257,-0.0049580806,-0.026502592,-0.016344303,-0.013027626,-0.0036244409,0.0021526457,0.0008504127,0.023869859,-0.004938787,0.004541882,0.0017659054,-0.0275394,0.01015152,-0.027538152,-0.01757444,-0.0016606264,0.001098809,0.0068651107,-0.1470246,0.001418731,-0.0051323418,0.002005708,-0.006389796,-0.0026375616,-0