603	By having a fully-equipped kitchen at your disposal, you can significantly reduce your dining expenses during your extended stay. Prepare your own meals, pack lunches for work or outings, and enjoy the cost-savings and convenience of cooking at home.\nAt Example Corp Waypoint Inns, we believe that feeling at home shouldn't be a luxury reserved for short stays. Our fully-equipped kitchens with full-size appliances ensure that you can maintain your culinary routines and enjoy the comforts of home-cooked meals, no matter how long your stay. Book your suite today and experience the convenience and comfort of our exceptional accommodations.	guest	local_guide	waypoint-inns	Example Corp Waypoint Inns.docx	Save on Dining Expenses	2025-12-18	[0.014369675,0.0065275095,0.013276892,-0.045541644,-0.026197938,-0.0095684305,-0.00736776,-0.0025242374,-0.021779558,0.020630784,0.0027877388,-0.0013040648,-0.019911233,0.018191623,0.13051102,-0.010172422,0.026785163,0.015700528,-0.00611466,-0.008719777,0.015960516,0.0034579332,0.029119343,0.012848052,-0.015447285,0.01177232,0.023868633,0.015217448,0.030154707,-0.002995166,0.004341974,-0.011345836,0.0062615797,-0.0029674333,0.007221962,0.008465006,0.0041977516,-0.022343349,-0.01573786,-0.011073843,-0.010340667,-0.015488212,-0.021892779,0.015167288,0.00813038,0.017232876,0.006094177,0.0035847682,0.008810291,0.037990846,0.03487452,-0.024330797,-0.020079289,-0.1664593,0.0074706413,-0.0013234548,-0.010414327,-0.011164608,0.0015186745,0.010052496,-0.008894445,-0.013190875,-0.02216534,-0.0073082442,-0.018719573,-0.015686214,-0.02279547,0.011501043,0.03563071,0.014509566,0.003332105,-0.010715209,0.00046282835,-0.016416498,0.012725638,-0.007659812,-0.014625472,-0.0191619,-0.0154894795,0.007035188,0.0067818672,-0.015757756,-0.020498583,-0.038273484,0.02541883,-0.037598282,-0.009393139,0.007784366,-0.013261471,0.03713847,-0.016484767,0.022144793,0.0009829598,0.010249761,0.016300097,-0.006272691,0.014349797,0.00017442547,-0.025551487,0.02482673