670	For those seeking a more affordable option without sacrificing comfort, our studio suites offer a practical and well-appointed living space, perfect for shorter stays or travelers on a budget.\nStudio Queen Suite: This cozy suite features a queen-sized bed, a kitchenette with basic appliances, and a work desk, providing everything you need for a comfortable and convenient stay.\nStudio King Suite: Slightly larger than the Queen Suite, our Studio King Suite offers a king-sized bed, a kitchenette, and a separate living area with a sleeper sofa, providing additional space and flexibility.	guest	local_guide	waypoint-inns	Example Corp Waypoint Inns.docx	Studio Suites	2025-12-18	[0.008439162,0.0011252409,-0.010776041,-0.04719651,-0.027369622,-0.022161072,-0.0055824276,-0.014480678,-0.047294572,-0.0058729975,-0.023368701,-0.017312882,-0.02937555,0.012972082,0.12017652,0.003548692,0.009607992,0.0020260802,0.0046929605,0.0015080655,0.0015614913,0.014555306,-0.0015487664,0.009517475,-0.03212961,0.01680223,0.03706229,-0.0040081386,0.021227948,-0.026459122,-0.0067436593,-0.021047475,0.026022531,-0.013314287,-0.009427587,-0.0038221162,0.0060390783,-0.030023288,-0.038827673,-0.0006556956,-0.010526323,-0.020695023,0.004446685,0.038730767,0.0038655929,0.00025530063,-0.0074281995,0.003044121,-0.0031821835,0.03505251,0.001986942,-0.0053832876,-0.0029717756,-0.16118884,-0.032493655,-0.0067276247,0.018011518,-0.0064188386,0.0017389209,0.008672751,-0.021958979,0.0039229877,-0.03974485,-0.022353211,-0.025919378,0.004430696,0.0003463377,0.018420491,0.017790046,0.008093201,0.005908499,-0.009490263,-0.0006719512,-0.013286945,-7.015073e-05,-0.013041392,-0.0064004846,-8.429875e-05,-0.035519745,0.03161818,0.020535272,-0.007979423,-0.031748902,-0.0025149158,0.032867294,-0.0166784,-0.016094,0.003575636,-0.019694734,0.014840139,-0.010332198,-0.001005262,0.024718827,-0.029403469,0.028290924,0.013861535,-0.020105654,0.009171075,-0.031111455,0.020435425,0.0042563025,0.0009677604,0.0068700192,0.0